  <!-- Weak permanent magnet embedded flush in the fixed top deck beneath the
       pizza-board centre.  This is a robot fixture, so it belongs in the
       robot description rather than being spawned by the pizza task.  It is
       visual-only: the existing deck collider remains the contact surface. -->
